      {
        "id": 236862,
        "name": "Justindoodler",
        "username": "Justindoodler",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/justindoodler/{size}/4832_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-15T09:38:44.968Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I am creating a hero, Britannia, a regular person who transforms into a goddess by holding a trident. I see these as two distinct personalities but would each be aware of the others character, like riding along but unable to act, or would one black out and possibly vaguely be aware of what the alter ego did? I appreciate this is a detail I would need to iron out, but I am interested in your  thoughts to what might work better in terms of being played, and how you may have handled such situations before.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c_2_353x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"y7MhF2RwKJm3P3IzPdLK1BMMvbm\" width=\"353\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c_2_353x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c_2_529x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c_2_706x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef2b050fb5c0ece8f40b2d702ca6ecf5adb5475c_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">4961×7016 3.41 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
